<model>
  <name>x500_indoor</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>
  <description>HYRAK indoor (GPS-denied) test vehicle: x500 + visual-odometry stand-in (gz OdometryPublisher, what PX4's x500_vision uses) + downward LW20 rangefinder (as on x500_flow) + OAK-D Lite forward RGB/depth camera (as on x500_depth). Flown with airframe 4005 and GPS disabled by hyrak_sim.sh.</description>
</model>
